accountExists.body:
Hello,

Someone tried to create a Lectype account with your address, but you already have one.

Log in: {login}
Forgot your password: {forgot}

If it wasn't you, ignore this email.

passwordChanged.body:
Hello {firstName},

The password of your Lectype account has just been changed and all your devices have been logged out.

If it wasn't you, change it right away: {forgot}
